#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:31
msgid "What is Bookings for WooCommerce?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:35
msgid ""
"Bookings for WooCommerce is a sophisticated plugin that lets online "
"retailers create an online booking system and easily transform their "
"merchandise into online booking solutions and make them accessible to their "
"customers for a particular time frame.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tThis plugin is simple yet powerful because it is a one-stop medium "
"to offer online booking solutions for nearly all types of businesses. You "
"can use it to book a hotel room, rent a product, reserve a course or class, "
"sell a tour package online, buy an event ticket,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tschedule an appointment, and many other things."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:42
msgid "As a Store Owner, you can-"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:44
msgid "With ease, create an unlimited number of online booking solutions."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:45
msgid "Define the maximum number of bookings per day or per user with ease."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:46
msgid ""
"Can offer easy booking management parameters from the backend i.e. admin "
"area."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:47
msgid "Confirm the booking requests made by the customers."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:48
msgid "Easy cancellation is allowed for booking orders."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:49
msgid ""
"Can easily define their offered WooCommerce booking services and additional "
"costs."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:52
msgid "The Free Plugin Benefits include-"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:57
msgid "admin/image/Adaptable-Bookings.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:60
msgid "Adaptable Bookings"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:63
msgid ""
"Customers can personalize their booking criteria to fit their budget, event, "
"and needs. You may make bookings without having to make a phone call, "
"allowing you to do it from the convenience of your own home offering all "
"WooCommerce easy booking services."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:72
msgid "admin/image/Availability-Settings-to-Offer-Bookings.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:75
msgid "Availability Settings to Offer Bookings"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:78
msgid ""
"Admin managers may quickly specify booking availability for the day, as well "
"as the exact deadline for booking online. They only need to change the "
"timeframe in the Availability tab of the plugin General Settings area to "
"perform easy booking management."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:87
msgid "admin/image/Ease-of-Setting-a-Booking-Calendar.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:90
msgid "Ease of Setting a Booking Calendar"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:93
msgid ""
"Merchants can use the WooCommerce Calendar Booking display listing to build "
"and monitor how their day or month is performing. They can also adjust "
"current bookings or availability with response to easy booking management."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:102
msgid "admin/image/Subtly-Stress-Additional-Costs-On-Demand-Surge.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:105
msgid "Subtly Stress Additional Costs On Demand Surge"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:108
msgid ""
"An increase in demand can have a direct impact on the price of bookable "
"products. When there is a significant demand for certain online booking "
"solutions in a given location, admin administrators can easily set up "
"WooCommerce bookings based on additional expenses."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:117
msgid "admin/image/Set-Forth-Booking-Limits-For-Day.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:120
msgid "Set-Forth Booking Limits For Day"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:123
msgid ""
"To avoid being overbooked, store managers can set a maximum number of "
"bookings per user for bookable products, as well as provide easy booking "
"management and effective tracking."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:132
msgid "admin/image/Easy-Booking-Cancellation-and-Confirmations.png"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:135
msgid "Easy Booking Cancellation"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/mwb-bookings-for-woocommerce-overview.php:139
msgid ""
"Admin managers can now effortlessly offer easy booking cancellation for the "
"booking requests by the customers making use of the plugin features. \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIn order to utilize the feature, the administrator needs to "
"turn ON the toggle for Cancellation Allowed settings available in the "
"specified booking\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tproduct setting and specify the Order Statuses for the same."
msgstr ""

